{
  "set": "town-buildings",
  "bead": "border_marches-bzc.15",
  "class": "towns",
  "exploration": false,
  "_doc": "Town-screen building art of the three v0.2 factions: one 64x64 sprite per building of each faction's tree (FACTION_HUMANS.md, FACTION_UNDEAD.md, FACTION_GOBLINS.md section 9), a single building in the map's three-quarter view on a transparent background, lit from the bottom left, styled from the faction's accepted map town. One generate-image-v2 call returns several candidates of a mixed subject ('each image a different one of these'); each accepted candidate's verdict names the building it shows, and outputs[] maps it to its file. Magic Guild levels share one sprite. Class contract: docs/art/classes/towns.md. Recipes are never edited after generation: add a new id (new seed) instead.",
