      "seed": 75101,
      "styleImage": "@restless",
      "subject": "Subject: each image a different one of these 6 graveyard town buildings: Potter's Field (crooked tombstones behind a low black iron fence); Charnel Pit (round stone pit heaped with bones under a little slate roof); Wailing Tower (tall thin crooked slate tower with a violet roof and moaning wind holes); Funeral Parlour (narrow black funeral house with a violet awning and a coffin by the door); Manor (tall gothic manor house with violet roofs and glowing windows); Royal Mausoleum (grand bone white domed mausoleum with columns and a crown on the dome). Materials: dark slate stone #5b5866 with #3a3842 shadows, steep shroud violet #7a4fb5 roofs, bone white #d8d0bc, black iron; spooky-cute, never gory.",
      "negative": "pennant"
    },
